  {
   "i": 1,
   "tipo": "CLASE",
   "titulo": "Lista de materiales",
   "html": "<div class=\"contentWrapper-0-4-702\"><div class=\"contentEditable-0-4-703 contentEditable-d7-0-4-1005 root-0-4-707 vmIc3WzjxMkUf+6rJDBJLA==\" contenteditable=\"true\" id=\"editor-content-editable\" role=\"textbox\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"user-select: text; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\" data-lexical-editor=\"true\"><h2 class=\"editor-heading editor-h2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡Pintemos a Rocky! 🐶</span></h2><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Te comparto la lista de materiales que usaremos. No tienes que usar exactamente los mismos o de la misma marca para realizarlo. :)</span></p><ul class=\"editor-ul-depth-1\"><li value=\"1\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Lienzo 20x25 (Igual puedes hacerlo en funda,papel para acrílico, etc)</span><br><br><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Preparación del lienzo:</strong></li><li value=\"2\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Gesso de la marca ATL.</span></li><li value=\"3\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Lija #280</span><br><br><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pinceles:</strong></li><li value=\"4\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Plano #11, Ideal para hacer el fondo y aplicar el gesso.</span></li><li value=\"5\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Punta redonda #16, para áreas grandes.</span></li><li value=\"6\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Punta redonda #6, para áreas de precisión</span></li><li value=\"7\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Punta redonda #4 o menor para los mini detallitos.</span></li><li value=\"8\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pincel con cerdas despeinadas, este es un truquito que uso para hacer pelitos y crear una textura más realista.</span><br><br><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Pintura acrílica marca Politec:</strong></li><li value=\"9\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Blanco&nbsp;</span></li><li value=\"10\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Negro</span></li><li value=\"11\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Rojo</span></li><li value=\"12\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Amarillo medio</span></li><li value=\"13\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Azul cobalto</span></li><li value=\"14\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Sombra café</span><br><br><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Para tus combinaciones de color:</strong></li><li value=\"15\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Godete</span></li><li value=\"16\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Agua</span></li><li value=\"17\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Papel/Servilleta/Toalla</span><br><br><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">Para finalizar tu obra:</strong></li><li value=\"18\" class=\"editor-list-item\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Barniz mate para pintura acrílica</span></li></ul><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\"><br></p></div><div class=\"tableCellActionButtonContainer-0-4-764\"></div><div class=\"blockTargetLine-0-4-792\"></div><div id=\"block-actions\" class=\"blockActionsMenu-0-4-786\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10000px, -10000px);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"root-0-4-59 root-d13-0-4-1027 blockAddAction-0-4-787\" data-testid=\"block-add-action-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.add\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M6 12h12M12 18V6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" draggable=\"true\" class=\"blockDragAction-0-4-791\" data-testid=\"BlockOptionsActionPlugin.DraggableBlock\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.reorder\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div>",
